1
00:00:00,209 --> 00:00:04,009
Hope he's right, because if he's not,
it'll cost him one of his three timeouts.

2
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,220
(Penny:)You know, Leonard, honey...

3
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:15,227
(Penny:)...I wouldn't mind if you wanted
to go fly kites with Sheldon.

4
00:00:15,391 --> 00:00:18,311
(Leonard:)I'll watch the end of the game.
There's three minutes left.

5
00:00:18,478 --> 00:00:19,728
Until halftime.

6
00:00:19,896 --> 00:00:21,356
(Leonard:)This is just half?

7
00:00:22,732 --> 00:00:24,362
(Leonard:)We've been here for hours.

8
00:00:24,525 --> 00:00:27,155
(Penny:)-You're gonna be here for a couple more.
-Oh, you're kidding.

9
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,650
(Sheldon:)-No.
-Nice meeting all of you.

10
00:00:31,866 --> 00:00:34,456
(Penny:)So, yeah, anyway,
that's my boyfriend.

11
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,460
(Penny:)He is really smart.

12
00:00:47,757 --> 00:00:50,757
(Raj:)I really like my saber-toothed cat.
Thank you.

13
00:00:50,927 --> 00:00:52,387
(Howard:)My pleasure.

14
00:00:52,553 --> 00:00:56,353
(Howard:)Maybe after lunch we can go
to Marie Callender's and have some pie.

15
00:00:56,516 --> 00:00:58,766
(Raj:)-I'd like that.
-Heh.

16
00:00:59,602 --> 00:01:00,642
[SIGHS]

